upstream: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cloudflare/skills/main/skills/sandbox-sdk/SKILL.md
verified: 2026-08-16
reason: upstream skill no longer exists — split into successor skills
note: HTTP 404 confirmed 2026-08-16 on the sandbox-sdk URL above. Confirmed
  via GitHub API listing of cloudflare/skills/skills/ that sandbox-sdk is
  gone and replaced by three skills, all HTTP 200:
  - .../skills/sandbox-next/SKILL.md
  - .../skills/sandbox-stable/SKILL.md
  - .../skills/sandbox-migrate-to-next/SKILL.md
  Local sandbox-sdk/SKILL.md is a stale snapshot of a single-skill concept
  upstream has since split into a next/stable pair plus a migration guide.
would_lose_if_wired: nothing to lose by wiring — the fetch would simply
  fail (404) every run, so .source is useless here, not merely undesirable.
to_vendor: not a refresh — a decision. Adopt sandbox-next and/or
  sandbox-stable as new local skill dir(s) (with their own .source), decide
  whether sandbox-migrate-to-next is worth carrying too, then retire this
  directory.
